{"id":"cb9c42d637018e25fb9803b9b66d45be8dd41a2c","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1239061","title":"Gemini 3.8 Flash 发布即王炸？又快又准登顶 DeepSWE 评测第一","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"etnperlong","excerpt":"人工智能 - @etnperlong - 今天 Gemini 3.8 Flash 正如预期发布了本来不带有什么期待，比较 Gemini 也就那样结果突然发现登顶 [DeepSWE]( https://deepswe.datac","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>今天 Gemini 3.8 Flash 正如预期发布了</p>\n<p>本来不带有什么期待，比较 Gemini 也就那样</p>\n<p>结果突然发现登顶 <a href=\"https://deepswe.datacurve.ai/\" rel=\"nofollow\">DeepSWE</a> v1.1 测评第一了</p>\n<p><img alt=\"FDw0xSEoPNwcKWDaypq7HPWIr79JtNHI.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nodeimage.com/i/FDw0xSEoPNwcKWDaypq7HPWIr79JtNHI.webp\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"Z4vkWuBMcLbLzYnD5O0HmCf9pQ9K5HOT.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nodeimage.com/i/Z4vkWuBMcLbLzYnD5O0HmCf9pQ9K5HOT.webp\"></p>\n<p><strong>这还是我认识的 Google 吗？？？</strong></p>\n<p>下班之前的 Hacker News 已经讨论疯了：<a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49537553\" rel=\"nofollow\">传送门</a></p>\n<p>总的来说就是<strong>又狠又快</strong></p>\n<p><img alt=\"TgOB77g97n5lJXtewH2n55LwTE8MzA5I.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nodeimage.com/i/TgOB77g97n5lJXtewH2n55LwTE8MzA5I.webp\"></p>\n<p>Gemini 拳打 GPT 脚踢 Claude 真的要成真了吗？！</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18044564\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/999ff6c94a747e90e4702c56f0821045?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"happy99\" data-uid=\"679730\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/happy99\">happy99</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 06:51:54 +08:00\">19h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>噱头比较多一点吧！　暂时观望</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18044588\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6ed4ee4dd2e384a9d8d47d2e7f43c5c4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"maolon\" data-uid=\"442547\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/maolon\">maolon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 07:49:42 +08:00\">18h 24m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>那 muse spark 1.3 还 75 分 deepswe 脚踢 3.8 flash 呢，</p><p>deepswe 现在不推出新版本测试就是下一个 livebench 了，很快就无人在意，已经被这些新模型玩坏了</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18044593\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3122/ad46/344778_normal.png?m=1667449277\" alt=\"Tumblr\" data-uid=\"344778\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Tumblr\">Tumblr</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 07:55:40 +08:00\">18h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>Gemini 这玩意儿差点把我心态搞崩！</p><p>我问它我的法师在游戏里的木桩输出是什么水平，它告诉我单目标 116k 是 very low ，5 目标 350k 是 quite low ，给出的平均数据是单目标 320-350k ，5 目标是 950-1100k~</p><p>PS 魔兽世界里的日怒奥法师</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18044639\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\