        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18044752\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/bedf/40df/438004_normal.png?m=1786379099\" alt=\"docx\" data-uid=\"438004\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/docx\">docx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 09:02:20 +08:00\">17h 12m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>过不了一周又要拉了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18044817\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5bac/490b/343585_normal.png?m=1783447811\" alt=\"ryougifujino\" data-uid=\"343585\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ryougifujino\">ryougifujino</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 09:12:45 +08:00\">17h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>DeepSWE 越来越像个笑话了，从 Opus5 全方面碾压 Fable5 就能看出来</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18044839\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fed6/d910/92455_normal.png?m=1749100411\" alt=\"Felldeadbird\" data-uid=\"92455\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Felldeadbird\">Felldeadbird</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 09:15:47 +08:00\">16h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>诚然 gemini 很强，但是 3.5 后 额度消耗那么快，同比其他家，你再强额度太快也遭不住啊。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18044883\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/031b/9c8d/375269_normal.png?m=1736237077\" alt=\"dingwen07\" data-uid=\"375269\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dingwen07\">dingwen07</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 09:20:50 +08:00\">16h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/zsxzy\">zsxzy</a> Android App 开发，只要装了 Android CLI 的 Skill ，AI 就能够直接自主查询 Android Developer 文档</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18044901\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6c2b/646b/621283_normal.png?m=1692511549\" alt=\"gpt5\" data-uid=\"621283\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gpt5\">gpt5</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 09:22:36 +08:00\">16h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>手机有跑分模式，模型也有跑分模式。<br>算力给够了都贼拉猛。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18045535\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fed6/d910/92455_normal.png?m=1749100411\" alt=\"Felldeadbird\" data-uid=\"92455\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Felldeadbird\">Felldeadbird</a